OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to tackle violence after
OL,4,ASouthport attack shelved due to costs,
OL,5,Ainquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmbitious responses to tackling extreme
OL,8,Fviolence in the wake of the Southport
OL,9,Fattack were not taken forward by the
OL,10,FHome Office because of cost, a public
OL,11,Finquiry has heard.
OL,13,FThe Southport Inquiry, set up after
OL,14,Fthree girls were murdered at a dance
OL,15,Fclass in July 2024, is hearing evidence
OL,16,Fon how the risk from "violent-fixated
OL,17,Findividuals" can be managed.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
