OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to tackle violence after
OL,4,ASouthport attack shelved due to costs,
OL,5,Ainquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hearing was told a Home Office unit
OL,8,Fhad identified key issues with the
OL,9,Fchallenge of non-ideological extreme
OL,10,Fviolence (NIEV) ahead of a meeting with
OL,11,Fthe cabinet secretary in June last
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FFour "high ambition responses" to the
OL,15,Fissues were set out by the Home Office
OL,16,Fbut the inquiry heard all of these
OL,17,Fwould require more money to be
OL,18,Fdelivered.
